item.description:
&ldquo;You are very lucky. Gaia must love you so much&rdquo;
&ldquo;Why do you say so?&rdquo;
&ldquo;Well, you are having a free massage from me. That doesn&rsquo;t normally happen. I&rsquo;m professional and I always charge what&rsquo;s right for my job&rdquo;
&ldquo;I know one thing but the other not so much. The massage you are giving me is actually not free at all. Whether I&rsquo;m having a payback or a giveback. You think this is a gift?

&ldquo;I&rsquo;ve been waiting a long time for this moment. Finally, the moon and fortune grant me this ever longing pleasure.&rdquo;
&ldquo;I told you when you stop looking, I would appear again&rdquo;
&ldquo;Well, I hope, with all due respect, you tell me what happened with the warrior. The kid you told me to choose to hold the medicine&rdquo;
&ldquo;He got killed&rdquo;
&ldquo;Ok, did he get to share and spread awareness of the medicine?

&ldquo;They want visions? We will give them that. An escape, a distraction, an answer.&rdquo;
&ldquo;What they pay for&rdquo;
&ldquo;Exactly. We&rsquo;ll make them believe what they already believe. Not a shift, not a blast. Not a slap in the face.&rdquo;
&ldquo;But isn&rsquo;t that what they get? A life changing experience? The curtains of the show unfolded?&rdquo;
&ldquo;No, the want the show to keep running. They don&rsquo;t even want something different to their expectations.
